WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.520
Part ten: manage stands. Create a Hub game with its stands and positions, right from your phone. You can edit it later, or delete it.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:16.621
Manage stands is in the Hub games card on the admin home screen. Managers and Full admins see it.

00:00:16.821 --> 00:00:18.920
Tap Manage stands.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.184
Pick a Hub game from the list to change it, or tap New game.

00:00:23.384 --> 00:00:25.710
Type the event name and the game date.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:32.280
Then when the stands open and close. If the game time isn't set yet, check Time TBD.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:40.064
Check Open sign-up at a set time to schedule it. Leave it unchecked and sign-up opens as soon as you save.

00:00:40.264 --> 00:00:45.598
Lock sign-up stops new sign-ups and self-cancels before the game. Hand-offs still work.

00:00:45.798 --> 00:00:49.148
Status overrides both: Open now, or Locked now.

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:55.500
Notes for the game show on the open spots board: parking, where to check in, what to wear.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:00.063
Each stand gets a short code, like 1W or SE.

00:01:00.263 --> 00:01:04.445
Start from layout fills in a saved set of positions. Here, Food.

00:01:04.645 --> 00:01:13.925
Each position has a name and how many people. Check Permit for alcohol spots, and Lead for the stand lead. Own time gives it a different start and end.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:19.660
Add position adds another line. Save as layout keeps this stand for next time.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:26.527
Add stand for the next one. This beer kiosk came from the Beer kiosk layout, with permits checked.

00:01:26.727 --> 00:01:30.430
The bottom shows the totals. Tap Create the game.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:35.014
Saved. It tells you how many positions and seats were created.

00:01:35.214 --> 00:01:41.010
The game stays open, so you can keep editing. Sign-up opens at the time you set.

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:49.190
Editing a game people already signed up for: here, SE Concessions Permit was cut to one, then saved.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:59.150
The Hub won't strand anyone. A position can grow, but it can't go below the people on it. The name and date can't change once anyone signs up.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:06.810
New times are saved and the people on those shifts get one update email. Send updates now sends it right away.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:19.380
Delete this game works only before anyone signs up, and it takes a second tap. To call off a game people signed up for, use Cancel a stand or game. That's part fifteen.

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:26.090
On a Hub game's roster, Edit stands and times opens this same form for that game.
